      "content": "hey so im type 2 diabetic and ive noticed for like the last two days im insanely thirsty like all the time and i feel like i have to pee every 20 mins. i started taking this new herbal supplement called \"GlucoFlow\" on monday though... do u think that's just making me dehydrated or something??",
